HST Office: the "Tự động lưu" toggle at the start of the ribbon's tab row (owner decision 21/11/2026, place A of
plans/261117-2258-hst-office-1-0-3/reports/autosave-toggle-proposal.md).

- sfx2 HstAutoSaveToggle.{hxx,cxx} (new, HST): "Tự động lưu", a sliding switch and "Bật", "Tắt" or "Tạm dừng" for
  the document of the frame (hst-user-autosave-filter.patch), its state from a status listener of
  .uno:HstAutoSave. Dimmed (about 40 %) with the reason in its tooltip and accessible description when the
  document cannot save itself; a click, Space, Enter or its KeyTip switches it. Ribbon palette in light and dark,
  sizes in logical px times the DPI scale (28 px high, switch 34 x 16), system colours in high contrast. Toggle
  button for assistive technology (checkable, checked while on). No icon or logo of any other suite.
- vcl NotebookbarTabControlBase::ImplPlaceTabs: the child "hst-autosave-toggle" is a fixed cell at the start of
  the tab row before the quick access toolbar, which shares what is left; in a row too short for its labels it
  keeps only its switch. The banner's room (row and page reserve) is not touched.
- NotebookbarTabControl creates it with the search box (the four Tabbed ribbons); the quick access ▾ menu has
  "Hiện Tự động lưu" (HSTRibbon/ShowAutoSaveToggle, every window); the KeyTips give it the digit after the quick
  access toolbar's.

License: the new HST files are HST-owned (LicenseRef-HST-Proprietary); the upstream files remain under their
original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/unit/test_user_autosave_patch.py; Linux and Windows shots (light/dark, 100/125 %).
